{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星電子定於12月10日正式發售的新款AI眼鏡，預售開啓後很快售罄，初步顯現市場旺盛需求。業內消息19日稱，三星電子這款名為Intelligent Eyewear的AI眼鏡於11月12日在韓國、美國同步開啓預售，備貨量在數小時內就被搶購一空。韓國官網在售的16款不同配色、款式版本，目前預售狀態均顯示售罄，無法下單；美國市場30款版本也全部售罄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587106.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:03:51.310683+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:56:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:10.583950+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:10.583950+00:00","content_hash":"598f5aea67dceb9009cda9e7f4a3eb723433a07571e96f39d0eafd5f2b0cea3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}